# FINAL MISSION

The mission of the Universal Reality Engine is:

> **Separate Reality from Simulation.
> Separate Evidence from Claims.
> Separate Working Systems from Beautiful Demos.
> And allow only proven truth to receive the VERIFIED status.**

### The Golden Rule:

# **NO PROOF → NO VERIFIED CLAIM**

This makes the system reusable for **JARSOL and any future project**, including AI, blockchain, quantum computing, PQC, Web3, SaaS, security systems, smart contracts, or any other software project.
